msgstr "舱室宽度"

#. CustomRocketInterior.STRINGS.OPTIONS.INTERIOR_WIDTH_TOOLTIP
msgctxt "CustomRocketInterior.STRINGS.OPTIONS.INTERIOR_WIDTH_TOOLTIP"
msgid "Width of the rocket interior world, in tiles. The vanilla Spacefarer Module is 12 tiles wide."
msgstr "火箭内部世界的宽度（格）。原版太空员舱为 12。"

