msgctxt "CustomRocketInterior.STRINGS.OPTIONS.REMOVABLE_WALLS_NAME"
msgid "Allow wall deconstruction"
msgstr "允许拆除火箭内墙"

msgctxt "CustomRocketInterior.STRINGS.OPTIONS.REMOVABLE_WALLS_TOOLTIP"
msgid "Allow deconstructing rocket hull and window tiles, including Neutronium. The four fixed gas/liquid ports and interior door stay protected. Applies to existing interiors after restarting and loading the save. Deconstruction does not expand the interior world."
msgstr "允许拆除火箭舱壳和窗砖，包括中子质墙。四个固定气液端口和舱门仍不可拆。重启并读取存档后对已有舱室生效。拆墙不会扩大内部世界。"

msgctxt "CustomRocketInterior.STRINGS.OPTIONS.ANY_SOLID_TILE_NAME"
msgid "Mount utilities on any solid tile"
msgstr "输入输出组件可依附任意实心砖"

msgctxt "CustomRocketInterior.STRINGS.OPTIONS.ANY_SOLID_TILE_TOOLTIP"
msgid "Inside rockets, cargo input/output fittings and the power plug can use any built solid tile as support. Rotation still determines the support side. Natural cells, mesh/airflow tiles and empty space are not valid supports. Utilities stop when support is removed and resume when it is rebuilt. Restart required."
msgstr "在火箭内部，货舱输入输出组件和电力插座可依附任意自建实心砖，旋转方向仍决定支撑位置。天然格、网格砖、透气砖和空地不能作为支撑。拆掉支撑砖后组件停工，补回后恢复。需要重启。"
